Garlic modifications vs upstream Producdevity/balatro-miyoo-mini-port v0.1.3:
- native/garlic-audio.c (new): ALSA helper replacing the Onion /dev/dsp path
- patches/garlic-platform.patch: BALATRO_PLATFORM=garlic gates (audio routing,
  no libpadsp.so/LD_PRELOAD)
- Upstream runtime retargeted to Cortex-A9+NEON, evdev auto-scan, L2/R2 axes
- Balatro.sh, Dockerfile, build.bat, package-release.bat: GarlicOS packaging

